    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d651">

                <pb facs="0784" n="692" sameAs="frus:frus1918Supp01v01/pg692"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 862.85/438</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Uruguay</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Wadsworth</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Montevideo</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-05-24T17:00:00-03:44">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 24, 1918, 5 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received 11.45 p.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Charter contract for ex-German vessels signed this afternoon will be handed to
                    Congress today. Minister of Foreign Affairs expects that it will pass Senate
                    Wednesday, from there must go to House of Representatives.<anchor n="2"
                        xml:id="d651-f1"/> Referring to article 10 of contract, what arrangements
                    have been made as to payment of the advance on charter price for repairs?</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Wadsworth</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d651-f1" n="2" xml:id="d651-f1-content">
                <p>The signature, on June 3, of the Executive decree promulgating the legislative
                    approval of the contract was reported by the Chargé in telegram of June 12, 11
                    p.m. (File No. 862.85/468.)</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
